OL,3,GNEWSAHomes evacuated after burst main
OL,4,Acauses flooding
OL,5,
OL,6,FA number of residents on a road in
OL,7,FLiverpool have been evacuated from
OL,8,Ftheir homes after a burst water main
OL,9,Fcaused flooding.
OL,11,FResidents on Elm Vale in Fairfield,
OL,12,Fwere told to leave their properties
OL,13,Fafter the main burst on neighbouring
OL,14,FPrescot Road on Wednesday evening, with
OL,15,Fpeople urged by Merseyside Fire and
OL,16,FRescue Service to avoid the area due to
OL,17,Fthe ongoing incident.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,405,400,260,160,0,100
