OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAHomes evacuated after burst main
OL,4,Acauses flooding
OL,5,
OL,6,FLiverpool City Councillor Steve
OL,7,FRadford, whose ward is next to the
OL,8,Faffected area, said a community centre
OL,9,Fwould be opening up for those who had
OL,10,Fhad to leave their homes.
OL,12,FA United Utilities spokesperson, said:
OL,13,F"Our teams are responding to a burst
OL,14,Fpipe in Fairfield. We are working
OL,15,Fclosely with the emergency services at
OL,16,Fthe site."
